### Infrastructure Layer

#### [NEW] [analysis-result.entity.ts](file:///c:/Users/amadeus/Desktop/OITrackerBot/src/domain/entities/analysis-result.entity.ts)

TypeORM Entity:
```typescript
@Entity('analysis_results')
export class AnalysisResult {
  @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()
  id: number;

  @Column() symbol: string;
  @Column() direction: 'LONG' | 'SHORT' | 'NEUTRAL';
  @Column('real') confidence: number;
  @Column('real') entryPrice: number;
  @Column('real') stopLoss: number;
  @Column() entryTiming: string;
  
  // Для адаптации весов
  @Column('json') filterScores: Record<string, number>;
  @Column('json') strategyScores: Record<string, number>;
  
  // Ретроспектива
  @Column('real', { nullable: true }) actualOutcomePercent: number;
  @Column({ nullable: true }) wasCorrect: boolean;
  
  @CreateDateColumn() createdAt: Date;
  @Column({ nullable: true }) evaluatedAt: Date;
}
```

#### [NEW] [analysis-result.repository.ts](file:///c:/Users/amadeus/Desktop/OITrackerBot/src/infrastructure/repositories/analysis-result.repository.ts)

Repository methods:
- `save(result: AnalysisResult)`
- `getUnevaluatedResults(olderThan: Date)`
- `getWeightsByOutcome(days: number)`
- `updateOutcome(id, actualPercent, wasCorrect)`

#### [NEW] [weight-adaptation.service.ts](file:///c:/Users/amadeus/Desktop/OITrackerBot/src/infrastructure/services/weight-adaptation.service.ts)

Cron-like service:
- Запускается раз в день
- Анализирует старые результаты
- Обновляет веса фильтров/стратегий
- Использует exponential moving average для весов

