### Presentation Layer

#### [MODIFY] [command.handler.ts](file:///c:/Users/amadeus/Desktop/OITrackerBot/src/presentation/telegram/handlers/command.handler.ts)

Добавить команду `/analyze`:
```typescript
this.bot.onText(/\/analyze\s+(\w+)/, this.handleAnalyze.bind(this));

private async handleAnalyze(msg, match) {
  const symbol = match[1].toUpperCase();
  const result = await this.analyzeCoinUseCase.execute(symbol);
  await this.sendAnalysisResult(chatId, result);
}
```

