## Implementation Order

| Phase | Описание | Файлы |
|-------|----------|-------|
| **1** | Types и Interfaces | `types.ts`, `interfaces.ts` |
| **2** | Base classes | `base.filter.ts`, `base.strategy.ts` |
| **3** | Core Services | `direction-resolver`, `entry-timing`, `stop-loss`, `confidence-scorer` |
| **4** | Filters (по одному) | `market-regime`, `btc-correlation`, `volume-profile`, `liquidation-cluster` |
| **5** | Strategies (по одному) | `oi-divergence`, `liquidation-hunt`, `volume-breakout` |
| **6** | Coordinator | `coin-analyzer.coordinator.ts` |
| **7** | Persistence | `analysis-result.entity`, `analysis-result.repository` |
| **8** | Use Case + DTO | `analyze-coin.use-case.ts`, `coin-analysis.dto.ts` |
| **9** | Telegram command | Modify [command.handler.ts](file:///c:/Users/amadeus/Desktop/OITrackerBot/src/presentation/telegram/handlers/command.handler.ts) |
| **10** | DI Registration | Modify [app.container.ts](file:///c:/Users/amadeus/Desktop/OITrackerBot/src/app.container.ts) |
| **11** | Weight Adaptation | `weight-adaptation.service.ts` |
| **12** | Tests | Unit + Integration tests |

